OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fwith isolated light showers through
OL,7,Fthe evening. Becoming mostly dry and
OL,8,Fclear overnight, though cloudier along
OL,9,FKent coasts. Breezy, perhaps strong
OL,10,Fnear coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FGenerally dry with good
OL,13,Fspells of sunshine, though there may
OL,14,Fbe some isolated showers. Winds
OL,15,Ffalling light. Dry with clear spells
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
